<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Jurys half-yr pre-tax profit up 39 pct.</title>
<headline>Jurys half-yr pre-tax profit up 39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.5		   vs 12.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.6		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     7.92		   vs 5.68</p>
<p> Turnover		   29.30		  vs 24.97</p>
<p> Operating result	 8.18		   vs 6.17</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.26		   vs 0.48</p>
<p> Tax charge		 1.5		    vs 0.88</p>
<p> Net taxed		  6.42		   vs 4.81</p>
<p> Registration date	Jan 28</p>
<p> Pay date		   March 10</p>
<p> Ex-dividend date	 Jan 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Jurys Hotel Group Plc said that the half-year performance was achieved against a background of buoyant market conditions in both Ireland and Britain.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom 353 1 661 3377</p>
</text>
